# Project Setup

All projects must be built based on this ASP.NET Blazor C# solution and project structure in the latest .NET version, currently .NET 9 where the web project has a single program.cs that registers everything. 

Full information about coding practices are defined in `.cursor/rules/developer.mdc` always refer to this. However it's very important you constantly check and follow this document whenever making changes to the application.

The front end of this CMS is built using the new Static server-side rendering (static SSR), and the admin is built using Interactive Server Side rendering.  When I say admin, I refer to any page served within the /admin/* url structure.

Always check the codebase and current structure before adding new things

